            <div xml:id="d307">

                <pb facs="0489" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg379"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856d.6363/507: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-08T16:00:00+00:19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 8,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 8—12:50
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>7. My telegram No. 6, February 4, 5 p.m. Am gratified to report Koloniale oil
                    bill approved this afternoon by the first chamber without record vote.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
